    ; type `content`, sees after those of the markup that gives it (`base`, seeing the style sheets
    ; `sheets` in their `levels`), found on the way to the slot's outlet (`follow-outlet`), the
    ; state cell of the `when` around each one the cell that outlet holds of those made there
    ; (`discovering`); then, where it `applies` them, those the rules the outlet applies bring
    ; (`outlet-applications`). None are found on the way to an outlet being followed already.
    ; Answers 0, 2 where one is declined, or 3 where the rules the outlet applies bring rules under
    ; the state cells of `when`s, which the function that builds the content brings itself
    ; (`root-applications`); `found` is given those found for 0, and those but these for 3. The way
    ; sees of `base` those that match in the markup of the class being filled (`scope-entered`) only
    ; where that markup `keeps-own`, as the class's chain does, and none found reaches only the
    ; markup of an element's class (`scope-pending`), which what a line gives a slot is not.
